# Namuna — buni `local.properties` ga ko'chiring va qiymatlarni to'ldiring.
# `local.properties` .gitignore da, shuning uchun maxfiy qiymatlar repoga tushmaydi.
# CI'da fayl bo'lmaydi — o'sha nomdagi muhit o'zgaruvchilari o'qiladi.

# Android SDK yo'li (Android Studio o'zi yozadi)
sdk.dir=/Users/<foydalanuvchi>/Library/Android/sdk

# Google Sign-In — Google Cloud Console'dagi **Web application** turidagi OAuth client ID.
# Android turidagi client ID EMAS: Android client faqat imzoni (SHA-1) ro'yxatdan o'tkazadi,
# ilova esa serverga yuboriladigan ID token uchun WEB client ID ni ishlatadi.
#
# Google Cloud → proyekt `studentclub-503706` → APIs & Services → Credentials →
# Create credentials → OAuth client ID
# (E'tibor: bu Firebase proyekti EMAS. Firebase — `studentclubs-d2905`, u faqat chat uchun.)
#   1) Application type: Web application  → ID ni shu yerga qo'ying
#   2) Application type: Android          → package `uz.studentclub.app` + SHA-1
#      (debug va release uchun alohida; `./gradlew :androidApp:signingReport`)
#
# Ikkalasi ham AYNAN bitta proyektda bo'lishi shart — aks holda Credential Manager
# so'rovni Google'ga yubormasdan rad etadi.
#
# Backend ham tokenni AYNAN shu Web client ID bilan tekshirishi shart.
GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=1234567890-abcdefghijklmnop.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Release imzo kaliti. Sozlanmasa release build DEBUG kaliti bilan imzolanadi — sinov
# APK'si sifatida ishlaydi, lekin Play Store uni QABUL QILMAYDI.
#
# Kalit yaratish (bir marta, xavfsiz joyda saqlang — yo'qotsangiz ilovani yangilab
# bo'lmaydi):
#   keytool -genkeypair -v -keystore ~/keys/studentclub-release.jks \
#     -alias studentclub -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
#
# Yangi SHA-1 ni Google Cloud'dagi **Android** OAuth client'ga qo'shishni unutmang,
# aks holda release build'da Google orqali kirish ishlamaydi:
#   ./gradlew :androidApp:signingReport
RELEASE_STORE_FILE=/Users/<foydalanuvchi>/keys/studentclub-release.jks
RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD=
RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=studentclub
RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=
